{
  "type": "function",
  "function": {
    "name": "task.update",
    "description": "按稳定 itemId 更新当前 Task 步骤。\n参数：必填 items（每项 id 必填，status/text/expectedEffect/verification/blockedReason/outcome 至少一项）；可选 taskId（默认活动 Task）。\nstatus：todo|doing|done。同一 Task 至多一个 doing；多 doing 拒绝。done 不可回退。验证失败时保持 doing 并写 blockedReason；完成时可填 outcome 记录关键交付成果与因果结论。\n工具成功不等于 done，须验证通过后再标 done。不传 taskId 时关联 ID 由 Runtime 注入；传入且不一致会拒绝。\n返回：ok、updated。Task 全部 done 后才可 task.complete；",
    "parameters": {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "reason": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "taskId": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "默认当前活动 Task"
        },
        "items": {
          "type": "array",
          "minItems": 1,
          "items": {
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
              "id": {
                "type": "string",
                "description": "稳定 taskItemId"
              },
              "status": {
                "type": "string",
                "enum": [
                  "todo",
                  "doing",
                  "done"
                ]
              },
              "text": {
                "type": "string"
              },
              "expectedEffect": {
                "type": "string"
              },
              "verification": {
                "type": "string"
              },
              "blockedReason": {
                "type": "string",
                "description": "doing 时记录失败证据或阻塞原因"
              },
              "outcome": {
                "type": "string",
                "description": "步骤完成时的交付成果、排查结论或因果事实"
              }
            },
            "required": [
              "id"
            ],
            "additionalProperties": false
          }
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "reason",
        "items"
      ],
      "additionalProperties": false
    }
  },
  "execution": "serial"
}
